name: Bodyguard
description: A fields four units and does all the killing; B fields one Wardbearer and each round picks exactly one ally to keep on the board.
design: Asymmetry 10 — the widest roster gap in the batch. Four units against one.
design: Player B has a single Wardbearer whose only contribution is standing in the right place, and Hold only reaches one ally at a time.
retired: Its own writeup answers no and points at `as-04`. Four-versus-one is `as-01`'s question with less to do.

